recommend keep-going the index fold for four rooms stands as the next crux -- active-designing 86 stale rows, counsel 112, expanding-prompts 78, waymarks 41, 317 together under a ceiling that only falls, each its own round since folding a room's index rewrites its front door. Beside it, one lap's worth of tidy that this lap named rather than took: three scripts still carry their own copy of 24576 where a fourth now reads it from the seated law, and a constant repeated four ways is a constant that can quietly disagree with itself. The session-log fold that would bring session-logs/README.md under its declared bound waits on Keaton's word and is listed as an open door.
